  "scopeDecisions": {
    "placement": "Bind an ordinary ground circle to a trap using trusted combat rules. Preserve accepted placement, commit transaction and action identity.",
    "arming": "Use the configured warning as activation delay. Zero delay can contact in the commit step. The active deadline is exclusive.",
    "contact": "Use eligible hostile NPC occupancy at fixed-step end and the existing circle/obstruction rules. Each new entry gets one opportunity. Continuous occupancy and capped candidates wait for a subsequent entry.",
    "budget": "Reuse normal area contact and damage handling. Store successful contacts by full identity and configured repeat interval.",
    "lifetime": "Retain committed plans while an owner is protected. End on source invalid, budget exhaustion or expiry. Departed frozen views omit traps.",
    "scratch": "Use one batch scratch directory and the project Cargo cache."
  },
